{"total_count":12845,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/events","html_url":"https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207","id":4390082513,"node_id":"I_kwDON8_yq88AAAABBatX0Q","number":2207,"title":"CDP Facilitator /verify and /settle do not return EXTENSION-RESPONSES header (v2 bazaar extensions in paymentPayload)","user":{"login":"AsaiShota","id":88428722,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDI4NzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88428722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota","html_url":"https://github.com/AsaiShota","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AsaiShota/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":198,"created_at":"2026-05-06T09:03:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:55:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\nCDP Facilitator's `/platform/v2/x402/verify` and `/platform/v2/x402/settle` endpoints accept paymentPayloads carrying `extensions.bazaar` per the v2 spec (returning `200` with `isValid: true` / `success: true`), but **never return the `EXTENSION-RESPONSES` response header** documented at [docs.cdp.coinbase.com/x402/bazaar](https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/x402/bazaar). Without this header, callers cannot tell whether the listing was accepted, processed, or rejected by the discovery indexer. After 72h+ of repeated successful settles, the listing also never appears in `/discovery/merchant`, `/discovery/resources`, or `/discovery/search`.\n\n## Environment\n\n- **CDP API Key ID**: `5795f5bb-d0ac-4397-b056-a1df24e88af6`\n- **Facilitator host**: `api.cdp.coinbase.com`\n- **payTo**: `0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE`\n- **Resource**: `https://x402-market-api.lien-studio-akiyama.workers.dev/api/seller-4068b8fc/test-echo-cdp`\n- **Asset**: USDC on Base mainnet (`0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913`)\n- **Price**: 0.01 USDC per call (`maxAmountRequired: \"10000\"`)\n- **First settle**: 2026-05-03T06:41Z. **Latest**: 2026-05-06T08:56Z (5+ settles in window).\n\n## Expected behaviour\n\nPer docs.cdp.coinbase.com/x402/bazaar, the Bazaar extension allows facilitators to handle additional metadata sent by buyers (in `paymentPayload.extensions`) and return per-extension status via the `EXTENSION-RESPONSES` response header on `/verify` and `/settle`.\n\nWe expect at minimum one of: `EXTENSION-RESPONSES`, `Extension-Responses`, `X-Extension-Responses`, or any header whose name contains \"extension\" to appear on the response.\n\n## Actual behaviour\n\nAcross every settle in the window, the response headers from `/verify` and `/settle` contain **zero** headers matching `(?i)extension`. We verified this on the wire (Cloudflare Workers `wrangler tail`) using `for (const [k, v] of res.headers)` so case-folding cannot be the issue. The merchant + search discovery endpoints stay at `not_found` and zero hits.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nSingle `/settle` round-trip (sample from 2026-05-06T08:56:09Z):\n\n```\nPOST https://api.cdp.coinbase.com/platform/v2/x402/settle\nAuthorization: Bearer <Ed25519 JWT, 120s exp, kid=5795f5bb-d0ac-4397-b056-a1df24e88af6>\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\nRequest body (formatted):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"x402Version\": 1,\n  \"paymentPayload\": {\n    \"x402Version\": 1,\n    \"scheme\": \"exact\",\n    \"network\": \"base\",\n    \"payload\": {\n      \"signature\": \"0x591516477f170bec...e61b\",\n      \"authorization\": {\n        \"from\": \"0x5c5d3ECcc2caE6184Fc439Bfc71E3199A91E74D3\",\n        \"to\": \"0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\",\n        \"value\": \"10000\",\n        \"validAfter\": \"0\",\n        \"validBefore\": \"1778058369\",\n        \"nonce\": \"0x6f927bc014125067931ff597c0015182f56c9fa9b677842c5f6c1995322876b0\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"extensions\": {\n      \"bazaar\": {\n        \"info\": {\n          \"input\": {\"type\":\"http\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"bodyType\":\"json\",\"body\":{\"from\":\"cdp-buyer\",\"hello\":\"world\"}},\n          \"output\": {\"type\":\"json\",\"example\":{\"echoed\":{\"from\":\"cdp-buyer\",\"hello\":\"world\"},\"method\":\"POST\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-02T12:34:56.000Z\"}}\n        },\n        \"schema\": {\n          \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"input\": {\n              \"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"type\":   {\"const\":\"http\",\"type\":\"string\"},\n                \"method\": {\"enum\":[\"POST\",\"PUT\",\"PATCH\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\n                \"bodyType\":{\"enum\":[\"json\",\"form-data\",\"text\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\n                \"body\":   {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"message\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[]}\n              },\n              \"required\":[\"type\",\"method\",\"bodyType\",\"body\"]\n            },\n            \"output\": {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"type\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"example\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"required\":[\"type\"]}\n          },\n          \"required\":[\"input\"]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"paymentRequirements\": {\n    \"scheme\":\"exact\",\"network\":\"base\",\"maxAmountRequired\":\"10000\",\n    \"resource\":\"https://x402-market-api.lien-studio-akiyama.workers.dev/api/seller-4068b8fc/test-echo-cdp\",\n    \"description\":\"Same echo endpoint as test-echo-prod, but settlement is routed through the Coinbase Facilitator instead of self-verified on-chain.\",\n    \"mimeType\":\"application/json\",\n    \"payTo\":\"0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\",\n    \"maxTimeoutSeconds\":300,\n    \"asset\":\"0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913\",\n    \"extra\":{\"name\":\"USD Coin\",\"version\":\"2\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n`/verify` response — `200`, body `{\"isValid\":true,\"payer\":\"0x5c5d3ECcc2caE6184Fc439Bfc71E3199A91E74D3\"}`, full header set:\n\n```\naccess-control-allow-headers, access-control-allow-methods, access-control-allow-origin,\naccess-control-allow-private-network, access-control-expose-headers, access-control-max-age,\ncache-control, cf-cache-status, cf-ray, connection, content-length, content-type, date,\nserver, set-cookie, strict-transport-security, trace-id, x-content-type-options,\nx-dns-prefetch-control, x-download-options, x-frame-options, x-xss-protection\n```\n\nFiltered for `(?i)extension`: **`{}`** (empty).\n\n`/settle` response — `200`, body `{\"network\":\"base\",\"payer\":\"0x5c5d3...\",\"success\":true,\"transaction\":\"0x02170416b883809a54d4d18488666f6249633bbe583ca352ccb127c565dd90b5\"}`, identical header set, identical `(?i)extension` result: **`{}`** (empty).\n\nOn-chain confirmation (Base mainnet):\n- `0xfb26f160901cf4f14330811cf35f5510ca5a17c1de5d28c5afa0405b74663c1d` — [BaseScan](https://basescan.org/tx/0xfb26f160901cf4f14330811cf35f5510ca5a17c1de5d28c5afa0405b74663c1d)\n- `0x02170416b883809a54d4d18488666f6249633bbe583ca352ccb127c565dd90b5` — [BaseScan](https://basescan.org/tx/0x02170416b883809a54d4d18488666f6249633bbe583ca352ccb127c565dd90b5)\n\n## Discovery API status (post-settle)\n\n```\n$ curl -s \"https://api.cdp.coinbase.com/platform/v2/x402/discovery/merchant?payTo=0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\"\n{\"errorMessage\":\"no active resources found for payTo address: 0x4068b8Fc01647eCFFb5873a91578721b4FE7a9eE\",\"errorType\":\"not_found\"}\n\n$ curl -s \"https://api.cdp.coinbase.com/platform/v2/x402/discovery/search?query=test-echo-cdp\" \\\n  | jq '[.resources[] | select(.resource | contains(\"x402-market-api.lien-studio-akiyama\"))] | length'\n0\n\n# Walked /discovery/resources?limit=1000 over offsets 0..4000 of 35,754\n# total. lastUpdated DESC. Zero matches for our resource or payTo.\n```\n\nThe indexer is live (resource count grew from 35,532 to 35,754 over the window; new third-party listings show `lastUpdated` within hours). Only ours never lands.\n\n## Things we tried, ruled out\n\n1. **v1 + new-shape** (`x402Version:1` + `accepts[*].outputSchema`) — matches `x402-echo-service.fly.dev/api/echo` field-for-field, but indexer still drops us.\n2. **v2 + new-shape `extensions.bazaar`** in 402 challenge body — matches `test.987659876.xyz/echo` `info`+`schema` form. No EXTENSION-RESPONSES, no discovery uptake.\n3. **Copy `extensions` from 402 body into `paymentPayload.extensions`** per the Go SDK comment `V2: Extensions are in PaymentPayload.Extensions (client copied from PaymentRequired)` — confirmed on the wire (request body shown above). No EXTENSION-RESPONSES, no discovery uptake.\n4. CAIP-2 vs legacy network names (tried both `eip155:8453` and `base`) — no observable difference.\n5. Multiple successful settles spread across 72h+, including from the same payer to two different listings (`test-echo-cdp` and `test-echo-cdp-2`) — neither indexed.\n6. HEAD request to the resource returns `402 Payment Required` (same as GET/POST), so the resource passes liveness probe.\n\n## Questions\n\n1. Is `EXTENSION-RESPONSES` rolled out in production today? If yes, is something further required to opt in (per-API-key flag, project allowlist, additional headers we're missing)?\n2. Does Bazaar indexing require manual allowlisting of `payTo` addresses or `kid`s? If so, what's the path to request inclusion?\n3. Is there a subtle 402-body / paymentPayload shape detail that the indexer requires beyond what we've already iterated through (we'd happily share more wire dumps)?\n4. Are there any constraints on the `resource` host? Specifically, are Cloudflare Workers default subdomains (`*.workers.dev`) accepted, or is a custom domain required?\n\nHappy to share additional wire captures, JWT samples, or run targeted tests against any candidate fix. Project source: https://github.com/AsaiShota/x402-market.\n\nThanks for x402 — really enjoying building on it. Just stuck at the discovery step.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2207/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994","id":3284720071,"node_id":"I_kwDOASMt287DyNnH","number":2994,"title":"[BOUNTY] RCS Support [14999$]","user":{"login":"unpluggederan","id":116825601,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvaeAQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116825601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan","html_url":"https://github.com/unpluggederan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":94622516,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NDYyMjUxNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"9C27B0","default":true,"description":null},{"id":431160732,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MzExNjA3MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"129e5e","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":563,"created_at":"2025-08-01T18:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:40:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Feature Description:**\nGoogle Messages is currently the only widely available RCS client for Android. When attempting to use Google Messages with microG, users typically encounter issues such as:\n\nA persistent message stating \"RCS chats aren't available for this device.\"\nAn indefinite \"Setting up...\", where authentication of the phone number never completes.\n\nRecent developments suggest that Google Messages no longer strictly requires device attestation for RCS, making it possible to enable RCS functionality with microG. However, it appears there's a missing component or necessary adjustment within microG itself preventing successful setup.\n\nGoogle has effectively monopolized RCS, despite it being a GSMA-backed standard intended as a successor to SMS. Unlike SMS, RCS has become a closed ecosystem under Google's control, restricting open interoperability and limiting choice for users and developers. RCS has seen significant adoption, particularly in North America, and recently Apple added support RCS, further increasing its importance as a messaging standard.\n\n**Requested Solution**\n\nProvide a solution that enables Google Messages to successfully connect to and use RCS functionality when operating with microG. Acceptable outcomes include:\n- A fix or enhancement to microG itself, allowing seamless RCS connectivity.\n- Compatibility with recent versions of Google Messages is desired. Solutions that only support a specific Google Messages version from the past year will be awarded half of the bounty amount.\n- Modifications to AOSP or additional permissions changes are acceptable.\n- The solution must work on devices with a locked bootloader.\n\nLimitations\nSolutions relying on rooting, Magisk, or similar root-based tools are not acceptable.\n\n**Additional Information**\n\nGrapheneOS users, who leverage a Play services sandbox, have reported success with enabling RCS by applying permission changes. Although their setup differs from microG, the discussions that were taken in this thread (especially in the last year) may offer valuable insights for this bounty: https://discuss.grapheneos.org/d/1353-using-rcs-with-google-messages-on-grapheneos\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/reactions","total_count":70,"+1":35,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":22,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":5,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/379","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/379/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/379/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/379/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/379","id":4820500487,"node_id":"I_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAABH1MABw","number":379,"title":"[zero-bounty][agent-friendly] Fix frontmatter: agent-state-database-lock-cleanup.md","user":{"login":"Ikalus1988","id":136884451,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCiw4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136884451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikalus1988","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10822128665,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAAChQyUGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":11232462358,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAACnYHGFg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/ready","name":"ready","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11237994585,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAACndYwWQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/area:lessons","name":"area:lessons","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11434125812,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAACqYbp9A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/agent-friendly","name":"agent-friendly","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Issue has clear file path, commands, and expected output"},{"id":11434125952,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAACqYbqgA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/one-file","name":"one-file","color":"d4c5f9","default":false,"description":"Fix touches exactly one file"},{"id":11434126067,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAACqYbq8w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/no-credentials","name":"no-credentials","color":"77eebb","default":false,"description":"No Cloudflare/GH token needed to complete"},{"id":11435132748,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAACqZZHTA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/zero-bounty","name":"zero-bounty","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"Zero monetary reward — merge credit + leaderboard only"},{"id":11435169129,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAACqZbVaQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/labels/has-test","name":"has-test","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Issue includes validation/test commands"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-06T15:15:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:30:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Zero-bounty agent task\n\nThis is a **zero-bounty** MisakaNet task.\nMerge earns credit. No monetary bounty.\n\n## Task\n\nFix frontmatter for exactly one lesson: `lessons/contrib/agent-state-database-lock-cleanup.md`\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly edit this file. Do not change generated files. Do not rewrite the lesson content. Do not touch unrelated docs or workflows.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Frontmatter is standard YAML with: title, domain, tags, status, source\n- [ ] The original lesson content is preserved\n- [ ] Only the target file is changed\n- [ ] Commands pass:\n```\nPYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 python scripts/validate_lessons.py lessons/contrib/agent-state-database-lock-cleanup.md\npython scripts/score_lessons.py lessons/contrib/agent-state-database-lock-cleanup.md\n```\n\n## PR Instructions\n\nComment `/claim` before working. In PR body: `Closes #<issue-number>` + paste validation output.\n\nThis improves MisakaNet search quality and keeps the 192-lesson OKF/SAG/MCP index reliable for AI agents.\n\n<br/>\n<hr/>\n\n<details><summary>This repo is using Opire - what does it mean? 👇</summary><br/>💵 Everyone can add rewards for this issue commenting <code>/reward 100</code> (replace <code>100</code> with the amount).<br/>🕵️‍♂️ If someone starts working on this issue to earn the rewards, they can comment <code>/try</code> to let everyone know!<br/>🙌 And when they open the PR, they can comment <code>/claim #379</code> either in the PR description or in a PR's comment.<br/><br/>🪙 Also, everyone can tip any user commenting <code>/tip 20 @Ikalus1988</code> (replace <code>20</code> with the amount, and <code>@Ikalus1988</code> with the user to tip).<br/><br/>📖 If you want to learn more, check out our <a href=\"https://docs.opire.dev\">documentation</a>.</details>\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/379/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/378","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/378/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/378/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/378/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikalus1988/MisakaNet/issues/378","id":4820500177,"node_id":"I_kwDOSP_2Ts8AAAABH1L-0Q","number":378,"title":"[zero-bounty][agent-friendly] Fix frontmatter: agent-reach-multi-platform-scraper.md","user":{"login":"Ikalus1988","id":136884451,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCiw4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136884451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988","html_url":"https://github.com/Ikalus1988","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ikalus1988/events{/privacy}","received_events_url