eted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.91-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/test-runs/TR-37256/folder/13176924/41237571/1455625236?sort=%2Bstatus_id\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** gocemate+b215490617@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Windows 10/Chrome\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Sign up with a account with the following format: [anything]@tstsg.com e.g: isagoicotest@tstsg.com\n2. Verify the first modal for the onboarding flow is \"What's your name\" modal\n3. Fill in the required personal details (First Name, Last Name) and continue\n4. Verify that the next screen is the \"People you may know are already here! Verify your email to join them.\" step, prompting the user to confirm their email \n5. Select the \"Skip\" option on the verification screen.\n6. Verify that the flow proceeds to the \"What do you want to do today? step\n7. Select the \"Manage expenses for employees\", > \"5-10 employees\" option and complete the process\n8. Navigate to #admins\n9. Select any of Concierge options\n10. Verify that Concierge provide an answer\n11. Wait for the new Concierge options\n\n## Expected Result:\nConcierge questions should not load long every time\n\n## Actual Result:\nConcierge questions  loads long every time\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74ccc7db-1a37-4e29-95cd-cbe9664e967c\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Svetlana Lazutkina\n> Bug ID: 7169516\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061798385854101836\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061798385854101836</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2061798385854101836</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-09</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @s77rt</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freedom-winds/BountyScout/issues/14","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freedom-winds/BountyScout","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freedom-winds/BountyScout/issues/14/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freedom-winds/BountyScout/issues/14/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freedom-winds/BountyScout/issues/14/events","html_url":"https://github.com/freedom-winds/BountyScout/issues/14","id":4824801081,"node_id":"I_kwDOTOXMzs8AAAABH5SfOQ","number":14,"title":"🎯 Bounty Alert: 11 New Opportunityies found","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https