l when an issue is open to proposals by contributors"},{"id":4664850679,"node_id":"LA_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFgv49w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"93074F","default":false,"description":"Something is broken. Auto assigns a BugZero manager."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"dmkt9","id":208698323,"node_id":"U_kgDODHB70w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208698323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9","html_url":"https://github.com/dmkt9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":72,"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:53:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Background\n\nWhen a report is submitted and the approver account no longer exists, the backend (`ReportAPI.php`) throws an `ExpError` with a descriptive message: _\"The approver account could not be found. A workspace admin must update the approver for this category or tag.\"_ (introduced in [Web-Expensify#51582](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/pull/51582), commit [`005ac29`](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/commit/005ac2986a67b4278a0f52e838b5c50116067228)).\n\nHowever, the NewDot frontend is **not passing this error message through to the user**. Instead, a generic _\"Unexpected error. Please try again later.\"_ message is displayed, giving the submitter no actionable information.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Have a workspace where an approver account has been deleted / no longer exists.\n2. As a member, open an expense report and click **Submit**.\n3. Observe the generic error toast — the specific approver error message from the backend is not shown.\n\n## Expected behaviour\n\nThe descriptive backend error message should be surfaced to the user (or a clear equivalent), e.g.:\n> _\"The approver account could not be found. A workspace admin must update the approver for this category or tag.\"_\n\n## Actual behaviour\n\nA generic _\"Unexpected error. Please try again later.\"_ is shown. The user has no idea why submission failed or how to fix it.\n\n## Context / references\n\n- Backend error location: [`ReportAPI.php#L3388-L3400`](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/blob/151b35fd0fff2849bf7ff7c7c1100625853d87a3/lib/ReportAPI.php#L3388-L3400)\n- Backend change that introduced the new error: [Web-Expensify#51582](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/pull/51582)\n- The error uses HTTP status code `666` which may be why the NewDot frontend doesn't recognise and display it correctly.\n\n## Platform\n\nWeb (NewDot)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060000152310746110\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060000152310746110</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2060000152310746110</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @dmkt9</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","id":3904303864,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otvL4","number":71,"title":"[BOUNTY] Ongoing Bug Bounty Program — Find Bugs, Earn RTC (133 RTC Pool)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029408,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":432,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:47:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Ongoing Bug Bounty Program\n\n**Pool: 750 RTC (ongoing, replenished as needed)**\n\n### Severity & Rewards\n| Severity | Description | Reward |\n|----------|-------------|--------|\n| **Critical** | Fund theft, consensus bypass, RCE | 100-200 RTC |\n| **High** | Data leak, auth bypass, significant logic error | 50-100 RTC |\n| **Medium** | DoS, info disclosure, moderate bugs | 15-50 RTC |\n| **Low** | UI bugs, minor leaks, doc errors | 5-15 RTC |\n\n### In-Scope\n- RustChain node software, attestation & fingerprint system\n- Epoch settlement & rewards, wallet endpoints\n- BoTTube web app, API, payment system\n- Python SDK, Block Explorer, Wallet GUI, Miner clients\n\n### Reporting\n1. Create GitHub issue with `[SECURITY]` prefix\n2. For critical: email first, issue after fix\n3. Include: steps to reproduce, impact, suggested fix\n\n### Rules\n- First reporter wins\n- Responsible disclosure required\n- Must not exploit on production\n\n---\n*Total RTC supply: 8.3M | RTC Reference Rate: 1 RTC = $0.10 USD*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issue