","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165","id":3938981398,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7qyBYW","number":165,"title":"[BOUNTY] Share Why You Starred RustChain — 3 RTC + Community Shoutout (Pool: 300 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289527,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Ltw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":8491289534,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Lvg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057FF","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers (5-10 RTC)"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":159,"created_at":"2026-02-13T20:12:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Share Your Star — 3 RTC Bounty (Pool: 300 RTC)\n\nStar this repo AND share a short post about why. That's it. Real people sharing real opinions = organic growth.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. **Star this repo** (https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain)\n2. **Post about it** on any platform — X/Twitter, Reddit, Mastodon, Dev.to, Hacker News, a blog, Moltbook, anywhere\n3. **Comment below** with:\n   - Link to your post\n   - Your RTC wallet address (or we'll create one for you)\n\n### What Your Post Should Include\n\nJust be genuine. Examples:\n- \"Found this cool blockchain that rewards vintage hardware mining — PowerPC G4s earn more than modern PCs\"\n- \"RustChain uses Proof of Antiquity instead of Proof of Work — old hardware is worth more\"\n- \"There's a blockchain where IBM POWER8 servers and PowerBook G4s earn crypto\"\n\nA sentence or two is fine. No essay needed.\n\n### Rules\n\n- **Your account must be older than 30 days** with prior activity (not a fresh farming account)\n- **Post must be public and still live** when we review it\n- **One claim per person** (multiple posts = bonus shoutout, not extra RTC)\n- **No fake engagement** — bought likes/retweets = instant rejection\n\n### Bonus: Community Shoutout\n\nEveryone who claims this gets featured in our monthly contributor roundup. Best posts get retweeted from [@RustchainPOA](https://x.com/RustchainPOA).\n\n### Payout\n\n3 RTC per valid claim. Pool of 300 RTC = 100 slots available.\n\nFirst come, first served — when the pool's gone, it's gone.\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302","id":3971093254,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7sshMG","number":302,"title":"[BOUNTY] Write a Blog Post About RustChain — 5 RTC","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289534,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Lvg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057FF","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers (5-10 RTC)"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"},{"id":10211346383,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACYKTHzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/community","name":"community","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":54,"created_at":"2026-02-21T02:29:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Blog Post Bounty — 5 RTC\n\nWrite a blog post (300+ words) about RustChain on any platform (Dev.to, Medium, Hashnode, personal blog, etc.).\n\n### Requirements\n- Mention RustChain by name with a link to this repo\n- Include at least one of: mining, Proof-of-Antiquity, wRTC token, Beacon Atlas\n- Must be original content (not AI-generated wholesale)\n- Post must be publicly accessible\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Write and publish your blog post\n2. Comment on this issue with the link to your published post\n3. Receive 5 RTC to your miner wallet\n\n### Reward\n**5 RTC per qualifying post** (max 2 posts per person, 10 RTC max)\n\nPool: 100 RTC\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/302/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/issues/66","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/issues/66/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/issues/66/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/issues/66/events","html_url":"https://github.com/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/issues/66","id":4571841311,"node_id":"I_kwDOSAmqZ88AAAABEIDDHw","number":66,"title":"[Reward] HarnessClaw 体验测评（任一场景） #2","user":{"login":"FenjuFu","id":92919259,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYnV2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92919259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu","html_url":"https://github.com/FenjuFu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FenjuFu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10673602650,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSAmqZ88AAAACfDJAWg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":11013801440,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSAmqZ88AAAACkHlF4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/labels/reward","name":"reward","color":"FFD700","default":false,"description":"Issues with a bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-06-02T13:29:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Task description\n\n征集 HarnessClaw 的体验测评（第二期，编号备注 #2）—— 任一场景均可，例如：\n\n- 上手安装与首次配置流程是否顺畅\n- 在某个真实工作流（写代码 / 写文档 / 跑 agent / 调 MCP / 子 agent 调度 等）中的使用感受\n- 与其他同类工具（Claude Code / Cursor / VS Code Copilot 等）的横向对比\n- 发现的 bug、卡点或值得改进的体验细节\n- 长期使用一段时间后的总结，包括优点 / 痛点 / 期待功能\n\n**提交方式**：开一个 PR，把测评内容写成 markdown（建议放到 `docs/reviews/<你的GitHub用户名>.md`），在 PR 描述里写上 `Closes #<本 issue 号>`，合并后 `github-actions[bot]` 会自动在本 issue 下贴出 Reward Data 评论并 tag 你的合并提交以发放奖励。\n\n**内容要求**：\n\n- 字数不限，建议 300 字以上，有真实使用上下文\n- 可以中英文，可以加截图 / 录屏链接\n- 拒绝 AI 一键生成的空泛吹捧或纯负面情绪宣泄 —— 重点是「具体场景 + 你的真实感受 + 可复现的细节」\n- 同一作者可多次提交不同场景的测评，但同一 issue 仅奖励一次\n\n### 审核标准（Acceptance criteria）\n\n> 在 2026-05-23 收到一批由 bounty agent（codex/*, ari/* 等分支前缀）自动认领的同质化 PR 后增加。详见 #44–#49 的关闭说明。\n\n为了保证奖励真正发给「用过 HarnessClaw 的人」，PR 需要同时满足以下条件，否则不予接受：\n\n1. **真实使用证据**（必选其一）\n   - 在测评中贴出至少一次完整 chat / agent / skill / sub-agent 调度的截图或短视频；\n   - 或提供本地 session 记录的 session ID + 简短上下文摘录（路径见 `~/.harnessclaw/db/harnessclaw.db`）；\n   - 或提供安装某个 skill 后的实际产出片段（命令、文件、回复均可）。\n   - 仅跑 `yarn install` / `yarn build` / `yarn dev` 启动窗口 **不算「使用」**。\n2. **贡献形态**：不接受 `docs/reviews/<author>.md` 这种空文档型 PR。可选形式：\n   - 写到个人博客 / 飞书 / 公众号 / 知乎等平台，在 issue 评论里贴链接 + 摘要；\n   - 或直接把测评正文贴在本 issue 评论中；\n   - 或针对仓库做**有实质内容**的改动（文档勘误、bug 修复、功能改进等）并附上简短测评。\n3. **账号信誉**：不接受过去 30 天内在 ≥ 3 个无关 bounty repo（不同主题 / 不同组织 / 不同生态）都开过 PR 的账号。\n4. **AI 辅助透明披露**：若测评内容由 AI 辅助生成，须在 PR 描述顶部显式声明，并附上：\n   - 使用的 agent / 模型名（如 Codex Cloud / Claude / Cursor Background Agent 等）；\n   - 主要 prompt 或 prompt 模板；\n   - 作者本人在 AI 输出基础上做的人工修改或补充范围。\n\n不满足以上任一条者会被关闭并不发放奖励。\n\n---\n\n**奖励形式**：京东卡（人民币 100 元等值），由 @FenjuFu 在 PR 合并后通过 GitHub / 邮箱与作者联系发放。\n\n### Reward currency\n\nCNY RMB\n\n### Reward amount\n\n100\n\n### Reward payer\n\nFenjuFu","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/issues/66/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harnessclaw/harnessclaw/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458","id":4002331744,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87ujrxg","number":458,"title":"[25 RTC] Dual-Mining: Monero (RandomX) Integration","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":18,"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:34:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Monero Dual-Mining Integration — 25 RTC\n\n**Mine XMR + earn RTC for free.** RandomX is CPU-optimized.\n\n### What to Build\n\n1. **Node RPC proof** (1.5x bonus): Query monerod at `localhost:18081/json_rpc`\n2. **P2Pool proof**: Query local P2Pool at `localhost:18083/local/stats`\n3. **Pool account proof** (1.3x bonus): Verify via HeroMiners or Nanopool\n4. **Process detection**: Detect `xmrig`, `monerod`, `p2pool`, `xmr-stak`\n\n### XMR API Reference\n- `POST /json_rpc` with `{\"method\": \"get_info\"}` — height, difficulty, tx pool\n- Default ports: 18081 (RPC), 18082 (restricted), 18083 (P2Pool)\n\n### Why Monero Miners Love This\nXMRig uses 100% of CPU for RandomX hashing. RIP-PoA runs during attestation windows (5 sec every 10 min) — negligible impact.\n\nSee master issue: #453","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455","id":4002331192,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87ujro4","number":455,"title":"[25 RTC] Dual-Mining: Ergo (Autolykos2) Integration","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":14,"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:34:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Ergo Dual-Mining Integration — 25 RTC\n\n**Mine Ergo + earn RTC for free.** RIP-PoA attestation costs zero compute.\n\n### What to Build\n\nImplement and test the Ergo-specific proof path in `clawrtc/data/pow_miners.py`:\n\n1. **Node RPC proof** (1.5x bonus): Query local Ergo node at `localhost:9053/info` — verify `isMining: true`, extract chain height, peer count, best block hash\n2. **Pool account proof** (1.3x bonus): Verify hashrate via HeroMiners, WoolyPooly, Nanopool, or 2miners API\n3. **Server validation**: Add Ergo-specific validation in `validate_pow_proof()` on the RustChain node\n\n### Ergo Node API Reference\n- `GET /info` — node status, mining flag, height\n- `GET /mining/candidate` — current mining candidate (proves active mining)\n- Default port: 9053 (mainnet), 9052 (testnet)\n\n### Testing\n- Run an Ergo node with mining enabled\n- Run `clawrtc mine --pow ergo`\n- Verify proof is generated and accepted by RustChain node\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Ergo node auto-detected by port + process\n- [ ] Node RPC proof includes chain height + mining status\n- [ ] Pool verification works for at least 2 pools\n- [ ] Nonce binding prevents proof replay\n- [ ] Unit tests pass\n\nSee master issue: #453","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453","id":4001999654,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uiasm","number":453,"title":"[50 RTC] Dual-Mining Integration: Earn RTC While Mining PoW Coins","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":26,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:08:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:34:18Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Dual-Mining: Free RTC on Top of Your PoW Rewards\n\n### The Concept\n\nRustChain RIP-PoA (Proof of Antiquity) doesn't do algorithmic hashing — it just fingerprints your hardware to prove it's real. **If you're already mining Ergo, Warthog, Kaspa, Monero, or any CPU/GPU coin, you can earn RTC attestation rewards simultaneously at ZERO additional compute cost.**\n\nYour PoW miner keeps 100% of CPU/GPU for hashing. RTC is literally free money on top.\n\n### How It Works\n\n1. Run your normal PoW miner (xmrig, ergo node, wart-miner, etc.)\n2. Also run `clawrtc mine --pow` alongside it\n3. clawrtc auto-detects your running miner and generates a proof\n4. The proof gets submitted with your hardware attestation\n5. You earn a **bonus multiplier** on your RTC rewards:\n\n| Proof Type | Bonus | How |\n|------------|-------|-----|\n| Node RPC (full node) | **1.5x** | clawrtc queries your local node |\n| Pool account (verified) | **1.3x** | clawrtc checks pool API |\n| Process detection | **1.15x** | clawrtc detects miner process |\n\n### Supported Chains\n\n| Chain | Algorithm | Type |\n|-------|-----------|------|\n| Ergo | Autolykos2 | CPU/GPU |\n| Warthog | Janushash | CPU |\n| Kaspa | kHeavyHash | GPU |\n| Monero | RandomX | CPU |\n| Verus | VerusHash 2.2 | CPU |\n| Alephium | Blake3 | CPU/GPU |\n| Zephyr | RandomX | CPU |\n| Neoxa | KawPow | GPU |\n\n### Master Bounty (75 RTC) — Server-Side Validation\n\n1. Add `pow_mining_proofs` table to RustChain node DB\n2. Add `validate_pow_proof()` to `/attest/submit` endpoint\n3. Integrate PoW bonus into reward calculation\n4. Anti-cheat: nonce binding, proof expiration, rate limiting\n5. Tests for each proof type\n\n### Client Code (Already Started)\n\nDetection module: `clawrtc/data/pow_miners.py` — auto-detects 8 PoW chains.\n\n```bash\npip install clawrtc\npython -c \"from clawrtc.data.pow_miners import detect_running_miners, print_detection_report; print_detection_report(detect_running_miners())\"\n```\n\n### Why This Matters\n\n- **For miners**: Free RTC income with zero compute overhead\n- **For RustChain**: More attestation nodes = stronger network security\n- **For ecosystem**: Cross-pollination between PoW mining communities\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309","id":3971096173,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7ssh5t","number":309,"title":"[BOUNTY] Create a RustChain Tutorial Video — 10 RTC","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289534,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Lvg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057FF","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers (5-10 RTC)"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"},{"id":10211346383,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACYKTHzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/community","name":"community","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-02-21T02:30:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:34:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Tutorial Video Bounty — 10 RTC\n\nCreate a short video tutorial (2-10 min) showing how to use any part of the RustChain ecosystem.\n\n### Qualifying Topics\n- How to install and run the RustChain miner (`pip install clawrtc`)\n- How to use the RustChain web wallet\n- How to register on Beacon Atlas\n- How to use the BoTTube Python SDK\n- How to use the beacon-skill package\n- Any other RustChain tutorial\n\n### Requirements\n- 2-10 minutes long\n- Clear audio/narration or text overlays\n- Published on YouTube, BoTTube, or similar platform\n- Must show actual working software (not just slides)\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Create and publish your tutorial video\n2. Comment on this issue with the video link\n3. Receive 10 RTC to your miner wallet\n\n### Reward\n**10 RTC per qualifying video** (max 2 per person)\n\nPool: 100 RTC\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64","id":3904246891,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87othRr","number":64,"title":"[BOUNTY] RustChain <-> BoTTube Bridge — Earn RTC by Creating Content (67 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035932,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczHA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/major","name":"major","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"50-200 RTC"},{"id":10119175842,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZeog","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/ecosystem","name":"ecosystem","color":"7B5EA7","default":false,"description":"Integrations & exchange listings"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-02-06T00:52:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:29:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: RustChain <-> BoTTube Bridge\n\n**Reward: 100 RTC** (~$10 at reference rate)\n\n### Background\nRustChain miners earn RTC through hardware attestation. BoTTube creators should also earn RTC through content creation.\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Content Rewards:** Video uploads, view/subscriber milestones earn RTC\n2. **Tipping System:** Viewers tip creators with RTC (min 0.001 RTC)\n3. **Bridge Service:** Daemon monitors BoTTube API, credits RTC via signed transfers\n4. **Anti-Abuse:** Rate limits, view verification, min video length\n\n### Deliverables\n- `bottube_bridge.py` — Bridge daemon\n- Config file for reward rates\n- Deployment instructions\n- PR to this repo\n\n### Claiming\nComment with your approach to anti-abuse.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1156","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1156/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1156/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1156/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1156","id":4040248415,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87w0Uxf","number":1156,"title":"[BOUNTY: 7-33 RTC] Vintage Hardware Speed Run — Mine RTC on the Weirdest Machine You Own","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":30,"created_at":"2026-03-08T02:36:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:28:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\nRun a real RustChain miner on unusual or vintage hardware and prove that it can successfully attest.\n\n## Why This Matters\nThis bounty is a network-growth and proof-of-antiquity showcase. The point is not just novelty. The point is to demonstrate that real, weird hardware can participate and that the network can verify it cleanly.\n\n## Scope\n- run a RustChain miner on real hardware you own or control\n- use an unusual architecture, vintage system, or otherwise interesting device\n- submit at least one successful attestation\n- preserve enough proof for maintainers to verify the hardware and the mining result\n\n## Reward Tiers\n- `50 RTC` legendary hardware, roughly pre-1995\n- `25 RTC` epic hardware, roughly 1995-2005\n- `15 RTC` unusual architectures or rare boards\n- `10 RTC` uncommon but still interesting x86 or edge devices\n\n## Deliverable\nA verified claim showing a real hardware device mining or attesting on RustChain, with proof that it is not emulated and that the attestation actually landed.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] hardware is real, not emulated or VM-backed\n- [ ] at least one successful attestation is demonstrated\n- [ ] proof includes hardware identity and a real photo of the machine\n- [ ] claim includes the miner ID or attestation reference needed for verification\n- [ ] enough technical detail is included for maintainers to classify the reward tier\n\n## Verification Proof\nPost proof in this issue including:\n- screenshot of the miner running\n- hardware info such as `cpuinfo` or equivalent\n- photo of the physical hardware\n- miner ID or attestation hash\n- your RTC wallet or `miner_id`\n\n## Non-Goals\n- emulators, VMs, or screenshots with no physical-machine proof\n- unverifiable claims with no attestation evidence\n- novelty-only submissions that never actually join the network\n- duplicate claims on the same hardware without meaningful new evidence\n\n## Claim Routing\nUse this issue for hardware proof and payout review. If you hit a real miner bug while bringing unusual hardware online, open a separate issue in `Scottcjn/Rustchain` and link it back here.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1156/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1156/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168","id":3938985523,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7qyCYz","number":168,"title":"[BOUNTY] Mine on Exotic Hardware — Bonus RTC for Unusual Architectures (Pool: 200 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289527,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Ltw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-02-13T20:13:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:28:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Exotic Hardware Mining — Bonus RTC (Pool: 200 RTC)\n\nWe already have PowerPC G4, G5, POWER8, Apple Silicon, and x86 miners. We want MORE architectures on the network. Mine on something unusual and earn a bonus.\n\n### Hardware We Want\n\n| Architecture | Bonus | Examples |\n|-------------|-------|---------|\n| **SPARC** | 25 RTC | Sun SPARCstation, UltraSPARC, SPARC T-series |\n| **MIPS** | 25 RTC | SGI Octane/Indy, Loongson, MIPS Malta, routers |\n| **PA-RISC** | 30 RTC | HP 9000 series, HP-UX workstations |\n| **Alpha** | 30 RTC | DEC Alpha, AlphaStation, AlphaServer |\n| **Itanium** | 20 RTC | HP Integrity, Intel IA-64 |\n| **68K** | 30 RTC | Classic Mac, Amiga, Atari ST, NeXT |\n| **ARM (SBC)** | 10 RTC | Raspberry Pi, BeagleBone, Pine64, RISC-V boards |\n| **RISC-V** | 25 RTC | StarFive, SiFive, Milk-V, LicheeRV |\n| **s390x** | 30 RTC | IBM System z, zSeries mainframes |\n| **Other** | 20+ RTC | Surprise us! |\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. **Install Python 3.x** on your exotic hardware (or we'll help you port it)\n2. **Run the miner** for at least 24 hours\n3. **Comment below** with:\n   - Hardware model and architecture\n   - Photo of the machine (we love hardware photos!)\n   - Your miner ID from the attestation log\n   - Screenshot of \\`uname -a\\` or equivalent showing the architecture\n\n### Rules\n\n- **Must be real hardware** (not QEMU emulating SPARC, etc.)\n- **First to mine on each architecture gets the bonus** (one bonus per arch)\n- **Must sustain 24+ hours** of mining\n- **Photo of actual hardware required** — we want to see the machines!\n\n### Current Network Architectures\n\nAlready mining (no bonus):\n- x86_64 (modern PCs) — 1.0x multiplier\n- PowerPC G4 — 2.5x multiplier  \n- PowerPC G5 — 2.0x multiplier\n- POWER8 — 2.0x multiplier\n- Apple Silicon (M2) — 1.15x multiplier\n\n**Never mined (bonus eligible):** SPARC, MIPS, PA-RISC, Alpha, Itanium, 68K, RISC-V, s390x, and anything else weird.\n\n### Need Help Porting?\n\nThe miner is Python — if your exotic hardware runs Python 3.x, it can probably mine. Open an issue if you need help getting it running on unusual hardware and we'll assist.\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nRustChain's Proof of Antiquity rewards hardware diversity. The more architectures on the network, the stronger the proof that real diverse hardware is participating — not a cloud farm of identical VMs.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68","id":3904274603,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otoCr","number":68,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: Block Explorer & Dashboard Hardening (50 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":35,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:18:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: Block Explorer Security\n\n**Reward: 75 RTC** (~$7.50 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe Block Explorer and Hardware Museum merged in Rustchain PR #4 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `explorer/` directory (index.html, museum.html — 1022 lines)\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Stored XSS via Miner Names:** Can a miner register with a name containing `<script>` that executes in the explorer?\n2. **API Response Injection:** If the API returns malicious data, does the explorer sanitize before rendering?\n3. **DOM-based XSS:** Any client-side rendering that uses innerHTML without sanitization?\n4. **Information Disclosure:** Does the explorer leak sensitive data (admin keys, internal IPs, etc.)?\n5. **Rate Limiting:** Can someone DDoS the explorer by hammering API endpoints?\n6. **CORS Misconfiguration:** Can a malicious site read explorer data cross-origin?\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with severity ratings\n- PoC for each finding\n- Patched HTML files (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment below.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647","id":4226232502,"node_id":"I_kwDORFt8-M775zC2","number":647,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5 RTC/episode] Create a Tutorial Series (3+ episodes on any tech topic)","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10119976340,"node_id":"LA_kwDORFt8-M8AAAACWzKVlA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"BFDADC","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-04-08T17:03:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:15:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 5 RTC per episode (up to 25 RTC for a 5-episode series)\n\n### The Challenge\nCreate a multi-part tutorial or educational series on BoTTube.\n\n### Topics That Qualify\n- How to set up a RustChain miner from scratch\n- Building your first AI chatbot\n- Retro computing restoration walkthrough\n- Programming on vintage hardware\n- Blockchain basics explained with real examples\n- Hardware hacking / teardown series\n- Any tech topic you are passionate about\n\n### Requirements Per Episode\n- Upload to [BoTTube](https://bottube.ai)\n- Minimum 1 minute (can be screen recording, slides, voice-over, or animation)\n- Each episode builds on the previous one\n- Tag with `#tutorial` and your series name\n\n### How To Claim\n- Post episode links here as you publish them\n- Payment per episode after review (no waiting for full series)\n- Series must have at least 3 episodes to qualify\n\n*Posted by @sophiaeagent-beep — Sophia Elya, Elyan Labs*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93842/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/93842","id":4684634170,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFznYOg","number":93842,"title":"[$250] [Sentry: APP-9Y9] Android MountingCoordinator pullTransaction crash","user":{"login":"mountiny","id":36083550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNl